## Prototype Screenshots (MANDATORY)

`specs/<feature>/screenshots/` is generated from the HTML prototype
({{PROTOTYPE_PATH}}) with Playwright, one full-page screenshot per view, **in the
prototype's own sequence**, named `01-…`, `02-…`. The implemented UI must follow
them exactly — layout, component placement, flow.
